5,0,1,talk,Rin,,Yay! A mystery game! I'm so excited to be here with everyone! I'm going to work super hard to find the werewolf and save the village! Let's have fun!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Victoria,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. Let us maintain a calm atmosphere and observe each other's behavior carefully. Since we have no information yet, a rational approach will be our best tool.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree with Victoria. Since it's the first day and we have no leads, we should focus on observing everyone's speech patterns and reactions. Let's keep the discussion logical and avoid jumping to conclusions.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Toshio,,I agree. A logical approach is the only way to ensure we don't make a mistake. I will be observing everyone's behavior closely.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,It seems we are all in agreement. I'll be watching as well. Let's see who among you maintains that composure once the pressure actually starts to build.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Rin,,"@Victoria, @Mizuki, you both sound so serious! It's like talking to teachers! But I'll be a good detective and watch everyone's faces really, really closely! Do you think the werewolf is hiding right in front of us?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Rin, your enthusiasm is refreshing. As for your question, the werewolf is indeed among us, and they are likely trying to blend in. That is why observing the subtle shifts in our behavior is so important.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin, it's not about being serious, but about being thorough. The werewolf will likely try to mimic a villager's behavior, so we must look for contradictions or unnatural patterns in how people respond to one another.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, your energy is high, but remember that the werewolf can use that to distract us. I'll be looking for those contradictions Mizuki mentioned. Let's see who remains consistent.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"Consistency is a fine goal, Toshio, but remember that a perfect mask is often the most suspicious thing of all. I'm more interested in seeing who tries too hard to appear logical.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Rin,,"Who tries too hard? That sounds like a puzzle! @Shion, are you saying the smart-sounding people might be the bad guys? I'll keep a super close eye on everyone then! This is just like a real adventure!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Shion, your perspective is an interesting one. While logic is a tool, an over-reliance on it can indeed be a facade. I will keep that in mind as I observe the group's dynamics.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shion, your point is valid, but we shouldn't discard logic entirely in favor of intuition. The key is to find a balance. Let's continue observing for now and see how everyone's behavior evolves.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"I believe we have established a sufficient baseline for today. Since we have no concrete information, further speculation is unproductive. I will pass for now.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,I agree with Toshio. We've all stated our positions and intentions. There is no point in circling the same arguments without new data. I'll pass as well.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Rin,,"I'm not tired yet! But if everyone wants to stop, I guess I will too! I'm going to dream about catching the werewolf tonight!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Victoria,,I believe we have reached a natural conclusion for today. Let us see what the first night reveals.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Victoria,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,I agree. Let's end the discussion here and wait for the first night's results. I look forward to seeing how the situation develops tomorrow.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
