67,2,1,talk,Rin,,"Oh no! Mizuki is gone! The werewolf is so mean! I can't believe they'd attack the wizard-person! Now that the Seer is dead, we're all in big trouble, aren't we? Who could have done something so scary?!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"It is a devastating loss. Mizuki's death confirms that the werewolf viewed the Seer as a primary threat. This suggests that Mizuki was indeed the Seer, as a werewolf would rarely attack a fake Seer who was helping them.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,1,talk,Shion,,"It's a predictable outcome. The werewolf couldn't risk Mizuki continuing to provide data. Now that the only source of truth is gone, we're left with Rin, Victoria, and myself. One of us is the werewolf, and one is the Possessed. This just became much more interesting.","{""words"":46,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Rin"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,2,talk,Rin,,"Wait, what?! One of us is the werewolf AND one is the Possessed? That's two bad guys! @Shion, you're making it sound like a scary movie! I'm just a little girl, I can't be a bad guy! Who do you think it is?","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Rin, please try to stay calm. Shion is simply stating the rules of the game. Since Mizuki and Toshio are gone, the remaining roles must be distributed among us. We must look at the facts without letting fear cloud our judgment.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Shion"",""Mizuki"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Rin, your ""little girl"" act is a bit too convenient, don't you think? In a game of deception, playing the victim is the oldest trick in the book. @Victoria, you're so focused on the facts, yet you've remained remarkably neutral. It's almost too perfect.","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, that's so mean! I'm not acting, I'm just scared! Why are you being so grumpy and accusing everyone? You're the one who's acting like a movie villain! @Victoria, please tell Shion to stop being so scary!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Shion, your accusations are becoming quite aggressive. While I understand the need to be critical, attacking Rin's personality doesn't provide us with any logical evidence. We should focus on the patterns of the game rather than emotional reactions.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Victoria, your desire for ""logical evidence"" is a convenient shield. You've spent the entire game playing the mediator, never taking a risk. That's exactly how a Possessed player survives—by blending into the background while the werewolf does the work.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, stop it! You're just picking on everyone because you're the bad guy! First you were mean to Toshio, and now you're being mean to me and Victoria! I'm voting for you because you're the scariest person here!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Toshio"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"@Shion, your logic is based entirely on suspicion of personality rather than evidence. By attacking both Rin and me, you are creating a chaotic environment that only benefits the werewolf. I find your aggression highly suspicious.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Shion,,"Chaos is a wonderful tool for revealing the truth, Victoria. You call it aggression; I call it pressure. If you're as innocent as you claim, you should be able to handle a little scrutiny. I'm voting for you.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
